        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New Development within walking distance of Bantry Town\r\n\r\nHelp to Buy & First Home Schemes Approved\r\n\r\nAn Fulacht Fiadh is a new family orientated residential development of Homes in Bantry, West Cork.\r\n\r\nAn Fulacht Fiadh will be great for community spirit given there are central communal green areas, a playground and wild flower meadow areas within the development.\r\n\r\nThe development has a very convenient location being next to all the amenities Bantry Town has to offer and in close proximity to the N71 National Road.\r\n\r\nThe following types of apartments are available:\r\n\r\n\r\nApartment 1- 1 Bed GF - 49.36sq. m - €200,000\r\n\r\nApartment 2 - 1 Bed FF - 45.54sq. m - €200,000\r\n\r\nArchitecturally designed homes with bespoke spacious layouts and a large selection of high-end finishes throughout.\r\n\r\nThe specification of the houses will include:\r\n\r\nAir-Water Heating\r\nAmvic ICF building structure\r\nHigh Quality Fixtures & Fittings\r\nHigh Performance uPVC Double Glazed Windows and Doors\r\nDucon Slab\r\nHelp to Buy & First Home Schemes Approved\r\nFurther Detailed Information on the Finish Schedule is available on request\r\n\r\n**Limited Number of Houses Available**\r\n\r\nPlease contact:\r\n\r\nMark Kelly M: 087 648 1920 E: mark@hodnettforde.com\r\nAndy Donoghue M: 087 237 2347 E: andy@hodnettforde.com\r\n\r\nCGI’s are for illustration purposes only and details are subject to contract.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: All information provided is to the best of our knowledge but is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No warranties or representations are made regarding the accuracy, completeness, condition or planning status of the property. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of all information provided, including measurements, boundaries, size or acreage, BER details and services. All measurements and distances are approximate and for guidance only. Photographs and video are for illustrative purposes and may include items not included in the sale (e.g. furniture)."
      },
